  "id": "math.secant",
  "version": "1.0",
  "title": "Axes.get_secant_slope_group",
  "license": "Apache-2.0",
  "author": "DeepBuild",
  "description": "ax.get_secant_slope_group(x, graph, dx) as the run from (x, f(x)) across dx, the rise to f(x + dx), and the secant line through both points, each a path@1 fn on the axes' scales; f is read at both points at check. a unit is the frame's short side ÷ 8 in u (fw, fh), so the frame is 14.22 × 8 units at 16:9; y flips and the origin moves to the frame's center; radians become degrees; a stroke width w becomes w × unit ÷ 100 u; font_size f is an em of f ÷ 96 units.",
